      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUFFY'S NO ANGEL (1) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.18) at Murray Bridge Straight behind Velvet Legend in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Leading chance again. AILEEN'S SHINE (5) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Zipping Colo (30.92) in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to give a sight. Will give a great sight again. EXULTANT MCLAREN (3) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (20.60) at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Winning chance. SCOTT SCOTCH (7) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
